REVYTECH, Inc. packaging of Wayfire — a 3D Wayland compositor.

Built from github.com/revytechinc/wayfire (master tip), with FreeBSD
compat shims and dependency pins for CloudBSD / FreeBSD desktops.

Conflicts with the stock FreeBSD ports "wayfire" package. Install the
full stack via x11-wm/revytech-wayfire-desktop or
revytech/wayfire/install.sh.

WWW: https://github.com/revytechinc/wayfire
